abstract: >-
  An experimental interoperability profile and reference implementation for websites
  that expose human-readable, machine-readable, retrieval, and agent-facing surfaces
  including SEO, llms.txt, Agent Skills, WebMCP, MCP, A2A, schemas, provenance, and
  bounded read-only gateways.
